[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はぁっ、はぁ……やった……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*pant* *pant* We did it...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はぁ、はぁ……こんなのじゃ、止められないわよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*pant* *pant* See? Nothing can stop us!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "鍛え上げられているな、まずは見事！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well trained, indeed! Most impressive!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あなたの旅路の先には、過酷な未来が待っています",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A harsh future awaits you on your journey."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それでも、パルメの庇護を受けずに進むのですか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And still you would proceed without the Palme's protection?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "過酷な未来……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A harsh future..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（師匠にも、同じことを聞かれた。\n\u3000私の答えは決まってる……！）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Miss Saskia asked me the same thing. And my answer hasn't changed...!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい。どんなに辛くても、私は先に進みます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. No matter how difficult it gets, I'll keep moving forward."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "パルメの庇護を受けなかったこと、少しでも後悔を\nしているならば、まだ間に合うと思ったのですが",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If you harbour any regrets about refusing the Palme's protection, there might still be time to reconsider."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いずれにせよ……あなたはこの先、\nもっと大きな選択を迫られることになる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Either way... you will face even greater choices ahead."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "では、またお会いしましょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Until we meet again."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いきなりで、すまなかったな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sorry for the sudden ambush."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こちらも、それなりに理由はあるのだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We had our reasons."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はぁ～～……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Phew..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あいつら、相当の手練れよ。今の魔物とは\n比べ物にならないくらい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Those two were incredibly skilled. Far beyond any monsters we've faced."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "また同じようなことがあるかもしれないから、\n気を付けないと……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We should stay alert... This might not be the last time something like this happens."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ホント、この１年で色々あったわよね。\n結局、あの二人はあれから一度も顔を見せないけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You know, this past year has been quite the ride. Though we haven't seen those two since then."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。何者だったんだろう……\nパルメ族の関係者なのは確かだと思うけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah. I wonder who they really were... They must've been connected to the Palme somehow."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（あの人が言っていた、「大きな選択」って\n\u3000どういうことだったんだろう……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(And what did she mean by greater choices...?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、ベップさーん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, Bepp!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お腹いっぱい食べた？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Did you get enough to eat?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ、おかげさまで。おかわりもしちゃった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, thank you. I even had seconds."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "二人は仲がいいのね。\nさっきからずっと話し込んでたし",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You two seem close. You've been deep in conversation this whole time."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I suppose so."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だって、友達だから！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, that's what friends are for!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――――！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ごめんなさい。でも、頑張って思い出そうとしても\n何も思い出せないのよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm sorry. No matter how hard I try to remember, nothing comes back to me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "仲良くしてくれようとするのは嬉しい。\nでも、前みたいにって期待には応えられそうにないの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I appreciate you trying to be friendly. But I don't think I can live up to your expectations of who I used to be."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "焦らなくていいんだよ、ヴァレリア。\n前から言ってる通り、ゆっくり思い出していこう？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There's no need to rush, Valeria. Like I've been saying, let's take it slow, okay?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア。これからも一緒に頑張ろうね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's keep at it together."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。レスナと居ると、なんだか楽しいもの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah. Somehow, being with you makes me happy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ねぇ、レスナ。今度は普通に友達になってね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, Resna? Let's become friends the normal way next time, okay?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（たくさん遠回りしちゃったけど……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(We took quite a roundabout way...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（私たち、また友達になれたんだ）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(But we've become friends again.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっ、レスナどうしたの！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? What's wrong?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お腹痛いなら、薬、あるよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If your stomach hurts, I have medicine."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ……あはは。\n大丈夫、潮風が目に染みただけだから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe... hahaha. I'm fine, it's just the sea breeze in my eyes."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（大丈夫。ヴァレリアと一緒なら……！）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I'll be alright. As long as I'm with Valeria...!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]